# A model's question batch, walked on both binaries: two questions, the first
# with described and bare choices; Down onto `Other` and past it (the walk
# wraps), back up, Tab to the second question, Enter answers it and returns to
# the unanswered first, and a digit answers that and submits the batch.
gateway question.json
wait 3
type pick a database
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap q1
key Down
wait 0.4
snap q1-down
key Down Down
wait 0.4
snap q1-down3
key Down
wait 0.4
snap q1-down4
key Up Up Up
wait 0.4
snap q1-back
key Tab
wait 0.4
snap q1-tab
key Enter
wait 0.8
snap q2
key 2
wait 2.5
snap answered
snapfull answered
gwlog
